  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Snake Turns: Island Adventure",
      "description": "That berry is just around the bend. Getting back to the path is the fun part.\n\nGuide a soft, clay-style snake through winding island trails with one finger: hold to turn left and release to turn right. A simple rhythm becomes a satisfying test of timing as narrow bridges, stones, and moving obstacles get in the way. Across 200 levels in 10 chapters, a safe finish is only the beginning—come back for the fruit and a faster three-star run.\n\nPrefer to set your own goal? Endless mode lets you collect, grow, and gradually pick up speed. Each extra bit of tail changes the space around you. No rival snakes, just one more careful turn and a chance to beat your personal best.\n\nCore gameplay works offline, with progress saved on your device. Play on iPhone or iPad, or use the included independent Apple Watch app; phone and watch progress are separate. In-game text is English and Simplified Chinese. The iPhone and iPad app contains ads, with an optional once-per-run rewarded-video revival when available.\n\nTake the next corner. See where it leads.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/snake-turns-island-adventure/id6829594977?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
